/* 文字の既定。フォントは Latin→JP→KR のフォールバック、CJK のロケールは JP を先頭にする（plan.md §3.10）。合成の太字は使わない */
/* Text defaults; fonts fall back Latin→JP→KR and CJK locales lead with JP (plan.md §3.10); no synthetic bold */
:root {
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/UI%20Toolkit/GameUi/Fonts/GameUiLatin%20SDF.asset");
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-default);
}

.game-ui-locale--cjk {
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/UI%20Toolkit/GameUi/Fonts/GameUiJapanese%20SDF.asset");
}

/* Mantine の Text/Title の写し（UiTypographyClass）。Text の root は margin 0・padding 0。USS に line-height は無いので、1 行は min-height＝字×line-height、LocalizedLabel は --localized-label-line-height で行送りと高さ（行数×行の高さ）を Web と同じにする（設計書 A-221） */
/* 和文の字の高さ 1.448em を画素へ切り上げると sm 21px・xs 18px になり Web（20.3・16.8）より高いので、高さは字でなく行の箱で決める */
/* Copies of Mantine Text/Title (UiTypographyClass); the Text root has margin 0 and padding 0. USS has no line-height, so one line uses min-height = size x line-height and LocalizedLabel gets the Web pitch and height (lines x line height) from --localized-label-line-height (design A-221) */
/* The CJK glyph extent 1.448em ceiled to pixels gives sm 21px and xs 18px, taller than the Web (20.3, 16.8), so height comes from the line box, not the glyphs */
.text--xs,
.text--sm,
.text--md,
.title--order-1,
.title--order-2,
.title--order-3,
.title--order-4 {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    white-space: normal;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

.text--xs {
    font-size: var(--mantine-font-size-xs);
    min-height: 16.8px;
    --localized-label-line-height: 16.8px;
}

.text--sm {
    font-size: var(--mantine-font-size-sm);
    min-height: 20.3px;
    --localized-label-line-height: 20.3px;
}

.text--md {
    font-size: var(--mantine-font-size-md);
    min-height: 24.8px;
    --localized-label-line-height: 24.8px;
}

.title--order-1 {
    --title-order-1-row-height: 44.2px;
    font-size: 34px;
    min-height: var(--title-order-1-row-height);
    --localized-label-line-height: var(--title-order-1-row-height);
}

.title--order-2 {
    --title-order-2-row-height: 35.1px;
    font-size: 26px;
    min-height: var(--title-order-2-row-height);
    --localized-label-line-height: var(--title-order-2-row-height);
}

.title--order-3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    min-height: 30.8px;
    --localized-label-line-height: 30.8px;
}

.title--order-4 {
    font-size: 18px;
    min-height: 26.1px;
    --localized-label-line-height: 26.1px;
}

.text--dimmed {
    color: var(--mantine-color-dimmed);
}

.text--white {
    color: var(--mantine-color-white);
}

.text--default {
    color: var(--text-default);
}

.text--muted {
    color: var(--text-muted);
}

.text--insufficient {
    color: var(--text-insufficient);
}

.text--high-contrast {
    color: var(--text-high-contrast);
}

/* 大きさのクラスより後に置き、揃えを上書きする */
/* Placed after the size classes so it overrides their alignment */
.text--center {
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
}

/* app/tokens.css の :where(.keyHintText)。並びの箱に付け、中の文字と KeyCap が継ぐ（line-height 1.2 は置く側の行で持つ） */
/* app/tokens.css :where(.keyHintText); attach it to the row so its text and KeyCap inherit (the row owns line-height 1.2) */
.key-hint-text {
    font-size: var(--key-hint-font-size);
    letter-spacing: var(--key-hint-letter-spacing);
    color: var(--text-high-contrast);
    text-shadow: var(--key-hint-text-shadow-face); /* look-exception: LX-86 */
}

/* 太さ。Web は欧文を Regular（MooresUI）、和文ロケールを NotoSansJP の Medium（欧文の字も含む）の各 1 字形だけ読み込み font-synthesis: none なので、Title（700）と fw={700} もその字形で描く。題と text--bold は字形を替えず親の字形（欧文 Regular・和文 Medium）を継ぐ（設計書 A-220。字の濃さは C2-c の Bold で和文 1.38 倍だった） */
/* text--medium・keyHintText（500）の欧文 Medium は C2-b の実測（LX-10）で当てたまま。合成の太字は使わない */
/* Weights: the Web loads one face each, Regular for Latin (MooresUI) and NotoSansJP Medium (Latin glyphs included) for CJK locales, with font-synthesis: none, so Title (700) and fw={700} draw with that face; titles and text--bold keep the inherited face (Latin Regular, CJK Medium) (design A-220; the Bold face made CJK titles 1.38x as dark) */
/* text--medium and keyHintText (500) keep the Latin Medium face set by the C2-b measurement (LX-10); no synthetic bold */
.text--medium,
.key-hint-text {
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/UI%20Toolkit/GameUi/Fonts/GameUiLatinMedium%20SDF.asset");
}

/* CJK のロケールは段階 1 と同じく JP の字形を先頭にする（JP/KR は元から Medium なので 500 は段階 1 の JP のまま） */
/* CJK locales lead with the JP face as in stage 1 (JP/KR are already Medium, so 500 stays on the stage-1 JP face) */
.game-ui-locale--cjk .text--medium,
.game-ui-locale--cjk .key-hint-text {
    -unity-font-definition: url("project://database/Assets/UI%20Toolkit/GameUi/Fonts/GameUiJapanese%20SDF.asset");
}
